OL,3,GNEWSAHeating oil users facing fuel or
OL,4,Afood winter choice
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the summer gone and the central
OL,7,Fheating going on, people who use
OL,8,Fheating oil in their homes are facing
OL,9,Fthe prospect of filling their tanks, at
OL,10,Fmuch higher prices than they have been
OL,11,Fused to.
OL,13,FMany will pay nearly double what they
OL,14,Fhad to last year because of a rise in
OL,15,Fprices since the start of the Iran war.
OL,17,FIt has led people like Liz Humphris,
OL,18,Ffrom Bishop's Castle in Shropshire, to
OL,19,Flimit how much they buy at once to help
OL,20,Fends meet. "Now, I just order 500
OL,21,Flitres at a time because it costs too
OL,22,Fmuch," she said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
